00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:03.980
First clip.

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:10.090
Dana Bash asks whether the economic recovery,
albeit slow, is a threat to Biden.

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:15.120
Harris, because as the economy improves, it
