are doing.

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:46.060
We need to talk about how the economy is doing
based on how working people are doing.

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:47.950
And right now, working people are suffering.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:52.710
People are standing or sitting in their cars
and food lines for hours.

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:58.060
What I like about this is that Kamala Harris
won't allow the conversation to simply be

00:03:58.060 --> 00:04:05.020
about the unemployment rate is now coming
down or stocks are up or we are getting jobs

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:06.709
back that we lost.

00:04:06.709 --> 00:04:08.780
She points out that's garbage.

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:11.209
It ignores why we are here.

00:04:11.209 --> 00:04:16.720
And that's the big picture that Kamala Harris,
I hope, is going to be able to utilize and

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:19.120
exposed during the debate with Mike Pence.

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:25.830
So if she does this with the Pence debate,
any time that Mike Pence points out, you know,

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:32.480
August saw some of the best new jobs numbers,
she needs to point out not only is a partial

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:34.610
recovery of what we lost.

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:36.490
Not that good.

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:40.860
All of it is much worse because of the failed
handling of Corona virus.

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:44.630
Then the topic that comes up is foreign interference.

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:49.470
And I like what Kamala Harris does here in
that she is asked about Russia.

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:52.020
Do you believe Russia's meddling?

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.050
And we know.

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:58.990
Oh, that there are some people who reject
that idea, despite the fact that Mueller confirmed

00:04:58.990 --> 00:04:59.990
it.

00:04:59.990 --> 00:05:04.740
The Senate select report confirmed, OK, etc.,
There are some people who have sort of like

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:07.480
a visceral reaction anytime, sometimes mentions
Russia.

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:09.490
They think it's a conspiracy theory.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:13.780
And I like what Kamala Harris does, which
she acknowledges that, of course, Russia is

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:18.670
doing this, but she immediately points to
the domestic voter suppression that the Trump

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:25.300
administration is engaged in and won't allow
the story or the question to only be, do you

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:26.639
believe Russia or not?

00:05:26.639 --> 00:05:31.960
She knows that just dealing with that could
be a turnoff to some viewers.

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:34.380
And she says Trump is suppressing the vote.

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:36.280
Take a look at this, Russia.

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:43.290
The Department of Homeland Security bulletin
said that Russia is trying to amplify, amplify

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:48.389
claims that mail in voting will lead to widespread
voting fraud and undermine the public's trust

00:05:48.389 --> 00:05:50.600
and the upcoming election.

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:54.190
Are you worried that Russian interference
could cost you the election?

00:05:54.190 --> 00:05:59.970
I am clear that Russia interfered in the election
of president of the United States in 2016.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:03.030
I served on the Senate Intelligence Committee.

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:08.470
We have published detailed reports about exactly
what we believe happened.

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:13.580
And and I do believe that there will be foreign
interference in the 2020 election and that

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:15.860
Russia will be at the front of the line.

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:17.610
Could it cost you the White House?

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:20.830
Theoretically, of course, yes.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:25.290
And that's based on what you're hearing publicly
or you mentioned you're on this side.

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:27.320
Let me just say something.

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:29.570
We have to be a realist and I'm a realist
about it.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:31.240
Does a realist about it.

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:37.180
We have classic voter suppression at play
in this election coming up, where after the

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:42.680
Supreme Court gutted the Voting Rights Act,
which Shelby v. Holder in 2013, dozens of

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:48.139
states passed laws that were designed to suppress
the black vote, to suppress students from

00:06:48.139 --> 00:06:51.840
voting, to suppress our indigenous people
from support from voting.

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:55.970
So much so that in North Carolina, Court of
Appeals said it was the law was passed with

00:06:55.970 --> 00:07:01.000
surgical precision to get in the way of black
voters from voting.

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.440
This is a good focus point.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:09.229
This is a smart thing to focus on because
the idea of the current administration suppressing

00:07:09.229 --> 00:07:15.460
the vote is going to be much more universally
compelling than an adjudication of.

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:18.080
To what degree do you believe Russia is doing
this or doing that?

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:19.080
And what?

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:23.240
Again, what I really like about this interview
is Kamala Harris answers every question.

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:28.120
She doesn't dodge the question, but then she
expands with proper context.

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:31.100
It's classic interview and media training.

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:33.650
Answer the question and then expand the framing.

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:35.820
Barack Obama was excellent at doing this.

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:37.940
On the first question about the economy.

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:42.199
Notice, she was asked, what about these improving
job numbers?

00:07:42.199 --> 00:07:47.400
And she said, well, improving relative to
the worst numbers we've ever had.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:51.289
And overall, much worse because of Trump's
failed response.

00:07:51.289 --> 00:07:53.380
That's how you answer a question here.

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:54.729
Do you believe Russian meddling?

00:07:54.729 --> 00:07:57.630
Yeah, I believe Russia will medal.

00:07:57.630 --> 00:08:03.710
And this is way bigger because we've got domestic
voter suppression, purging of votes, voters

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:06.570
in disproportionately black areas and on and
on.

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:08.740
This is how you actually deal with issues
in interviews.

00:08:08.740 --> 00:08:10.729
Now, one more clip.

00:08:10.729 --> 00:08:14.419
And I encourage you to check out the full
interview, Kamala Harris, on whether she would

00:08:14.419 --> 00:08:19.259
