vaccine prism.

00:08:38.459 --> 00:08:39.789
And that's not what this is about.

00:08:39.789 --> 00:08:43.740
This is not about do we trust vaccines in
general due back vaccines work in general.

00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:48.170
It's is Trump, for political reasons, going
to try to force something that's just not

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:49.339
yet ready.

00:08:49.339 --> 00:08:53.149
Kamala Harris does a perfect job of refocusing
