00:08:53.149 --> 00:08:57.730
I missed a corona virus vaccine by the end
of the year or maybe sooner.

00:08:57.730 --> 00:08:59.319
Would you trust that vaccine?

00:08:59.319 --> 00:09:04.660
I think that we have learned since this pandemic
started, but really before that, that there's

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:08.980
very little that we can trust that comes out
of Donald Trump's mouth.

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:12.139
From the beginning of this pandemic, he has
called it a hoax.

00:09:12.139 --> 00:09:17.880
His muzzle, the public health experts, he
has minimized the seriousness of it.

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:22.509
He has created false expectations for the
American people and American families, even

00:09:22.509 --> 00:09:26.999
though if he had listened to the scientists
and the experts, he would have understood

00:09:26.999 --> 00:09:29.970
the gravity of it and the power that he has.

00:09:29.970 --> 00:09:33.170
President, United States has to actually save
lives.

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:34.670
And none of those were his priorities.

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:40.569
His priority was to to do whatever he thought
was politically expedient.

00:09:40.569 --> 00:09:44.160
And so, no, I would not trust his word.

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:48.290
I would trust sort of public health experts
and scientists, but not Donald Trump.

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:51.009
This is really a clinic on how to answer.

00:09:51.009 --> 00:09:52.009
It's not.

00:09:52.009 --> 00:09:55.199
I do or don't trust the vaccine.

00:09:55.199 --> 00:10:02.749
It's I don't make a decision on whether the
vaccine is okay on Trump's word because Trump

00:10:02.749 --> 00:10:04.399
is unreliable.

00:10:04.399 --> 00:10:10.110
It's not about vaccines being the problem
and getting into maybe always is.

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:11.759
She may be against vaccines.

00:10:11.759 --> 00:10:16.480
No, it's about I don't trust Trump's word
on anything.

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:23.410
And as a media literacy person, as a fan of
the techniques of interviewing and being interviewed,

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:26.029
